templates.generic:
{prompt}

A single game asset, centred. {style}

On a solid #00b140 chroma-green background. No shadow, no gradient background, no text, no watermark, no frame.

templates.character:
{prompt}

A single game character sprite for a {width}x{height} pixel cell. Full body, side-on, feet flat on an invisible ground line, consistent limb proportions, and a silhouette that reads at a glance. {style}

Solid #00b140 chroma-green background, no shadow, no ground plane, no text, no watermark.

templates.anchor:
{prompt}

The canonical South-facing idle frame for {name}, a {archetype}: one {width}x{height} logical sprite cell. One character only, centred, whole body inside the cell, facing the camera in three-quarter top-down perspective, feet planted at bottom centre. A calm, readable idle - not an attack, not a stride, and carrying nothing the character should not be holding in every single frame derived from this one. Wearing {costume}, carrying {prop}. Hold the silhouette: {silhouette}. {style}

Any image supplied alongside this prompt is a reference for discipline: take the treatment from it and never take its content. Solid #00b140 chroma-green background outside the silhouette, no scenery, no ground plane, no shadow, no border, no text, no watermark.

templates.direction:
{prompt}

The same character as the supplied anchor - {name} - redrawn as a {width}x{height} logical sprite cell facing {direction}, in the same neutral idle stance. Hold the direction-specific silhouette: {silhouette}. Preserve the identity exactly: same outfit, same palette, same proportions, same accessories, same silhouette weight and the same treatment, so that this frame and the anchor read as one character rather than two. Both feet visible and planted on one baseline, hands neutral and empty, whole body inside the cell with even padding on every side. Accessories stay where they naturally sit on the body from this view - a prop that would be awkward here becomes less visible rather than moving to the wrong side of the body. This is a neutral anchor that walk, idle and attack frames will later be generated from, so no action pose, no glow, no particles, no projectile, no aura, no flame, and no drawn weapon unless the character carries it at rest. {style}

Solid #00b140 chroma-green background, no shadow, no ground plane, no scenery, no second character, no text, no watermark.

templates.neutral-pose:
{prompt}

Redraw {name} as its canonical South-facing neutral idle, at {width}x{height} logical sprite size. The supplied image is the identity to preserve: keep the same face, silhouette, proportions, costume colours, prop size and detail, centred composition and sprite scale. The one intended correction is to remove {remove}. Beyond that, the pose - hands empty and resting naturally, weight settled, a calm readable idle. Remove every glow, particle, trail, smoke, aura, projectile and charged wind-up, so that nothing remains that the character should not be holding in every single frame derived from this one. {style}

Solid #00b140 chroma-green background outside the silhouette, uniform, with no gradient, no noise, no shadow, no scenery, no border, no text, no watermark. Do not redesign the character, do not simplify identifying detail, and do not change the scale or the silhouette.

templates.icon:
{prompt}

A single game icon for a {width}x{height} cell. One object, centred, filling the cell with a small even margin, high-contrast silhouette that reads at a glance when small. {style}

Solid #00b140 chroma-green background, no shadow, no text, no watermark.

templates.tile:
{prompt}

A single seamless terrain tile, {width}x{height}. The pattern continues across every edge so the tile meets itself when repeated: no border, no vignette, no framing, no single dominant feature in the middle. Even lighting from directly above, no perspective, no shadow. {style}

No text, no watermark.

templates.ui:
{prompt}

A single game UI panel, {width}x{height}, drawn straight on with no perspective. A uniform border of even thickness on all four sides and a plain fillable centre, so it can be stretched as a nine-patch. {style}

Solid #00b140 chroma-green background outside the panel, no shadow, no text, no watermark.

templates.banner:
{prompt}

A single wide game banner, {width}x{height}. Composition reads across the width, with the subject left of centre and clear space for a title. No letterboxing. {style}

Solid #00b140 chroma-green background behind any cut-out subject, no text, no watermark.

templates.background:
{prompt}

One parallax background layer, {width}x{height}, drawn straight on with no perspective and no camera vignette. The composition tiles horizontally: the left and right edges continue into each other. Even lighting, no foreground characters. {style}

No text, no watermark.

templates.map:
{prompt}

A single top-down map piece, {width}x{height}, drawn from directly above with no perspective and no isometric skew. Even lighting, consistent scale across the whole piece. {style}

Solid #00b140 chroma-green background outside the piece, no shadow, no text, no watermark.
